DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261022
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTSTAMP:20261101T165926Z
UID:1a213b2f5ab356ec8575bcaca10e@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Before she was hit-maker Carole King — she was Carole Klein
 \, a spunky\, young songwriter from Brooklyn with a unique voice. From the
  chart-topping hits she wrote for the biggest acts in music to her own lif
 e-changing\, trailblazing success with “Tapestry”\, Beautiful: The Car
 ole King Musical takes you back to where it all began — and takes you on
