DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTSTAMP:20261101T165926Z
UID:7c1c5bfba37fbcb0c624131e6207@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Fall and early winter can be a tricky time for bird identifica
 tion\, with many young birds and birds in non-breeding plumage lacking the
 ir usual distinguishing field marks. Add in differences between males and 
 females\, and identifying birds in the field or at your feeders can become
  quite a challenge. Join us at the RTP Estuary Center for an in-person pre
 sentation on how to identify some of our more cryptic and similar-looking 
 species\, and learn which birds to keep an eye out for this fall and winte
 r.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/tricky-bird-id
LOCATION:RTP Estuary Center\, 100 Lyme Street\, Old Lyme CT\, 06371
